<http://data.silknow.org/object/532c8367-f832-3065-a57b-ad4112c5445c>
        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Dress fabric fragment of brocaded silk. Jacquard woven lilac silk tabby with a pattern of scrolling stems in white (pattern weft bound in 3/1 twill on the surface, and in tabby on the back) surrounding a small spray of flowers and berries brocaded in shades of green, pink and brown silk.\n\nThe small fragment has a ribbed selvedge on the right side. An area of plain lilac silk at the top and bottom seems to indicate that it was intended as a sample."@en , "Dress fabric fragment of brocaded silk, England, 1850-1875"@en ;
        ecrm:P138i_has_representation  <http://data.silknow.org/image/cebc2080-7041-3236-a7a2-033841217c73> , <http://data.silknow.org/image/0c49c8a5-0a2b-37c4-863b-1e709921bff2> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note               "Dress fabric fragment of brocaded silk. Jacquard woven lilac silk tabby with a pattern of scrolling stems in white (pattern weft bound in 3/1 twill on the surface, and in tabby on the back) surrounding a small spray of flowers and berries brocaded in shades of green, pink and brown silk.\n\nThe small fragment has a ribbed selvedge on the right side. An area of plain lilac silk at the top and bottom seems to indicate that it was intended as a sample."@en , "Dress fabric fragment of brocaded silk, England, 1850-1875"@en ;
        ecrm:P43_has_dimension         <http://data.silknow.org/object/532c8367-f832-3065-a57b-ad4112c5445c/dimension/1> , <http://data.silknow.org/object/532c8367-f832-3065-a57b-ad4112c5445c/dimension/2> ;
